[00:00.00] 作曲 : George Miller/Daniel Wilson/Isaac Cords Sleator/Stella Rose Bennett
[00:01.00] 作词 : Joji
[00:02.67]Lately i’ve been slipping away from ya (近来我一直回避着你)
[00:08.34]Can you tell me does it hurt today? (你能否告诉我今天是否心伤？)
[00:13.35]Yeah, there’s no way, yeah (是的，已无办法)
[00:19.24]To burn, there’s no flames yeah (欲燃，无烈焰的闪耀)
[00:26.34]Praying 9 to 5 like a saint for you (从早到晚像圣徒一样为你祈祷)
[00:31.45]Can you tell me how it turned this way? (你能否告诉我为何会变成这般？)
[00:36.84]Yeah, things have changed yeah (是的，世事已变迁)
[00:42.24]Yeah, filled with rage, yeah (filled with rage) (是的，被疯狂填满)
[00:48.05]So lost in these diamonds (迷失在珠光宝气中)
[00:50.72]So lost in this paradise (迷失在人外极地中)
[00:53.54]Don’t speed on that highway (不要在那条公路上加速驰骋)
[00:56.42]We need you to shine bright (我们需要你发光发热)
[00:59.31]When life gets too complicated (当生活的境地变得复杂不堪)
[01:02.13]will you stand with me after dark (请于黑夜中站在我身旁)
[01:04.89]I'll stay in the limelight (我会留在聚光灯下)
[01:07.93]Like a beautiful afterthought (像事后出现的美好想法)
[01:10.77]Like a beautiful afterthought (像事后出现的美好想法)
[01:13.60]Sometimes you does me for something different (有时你因为一些特别的原因待我)
[01:16.87]Hated when you did it (讨厌你这样)
[01:19.60]I wish that you didn’t (多希望你没有这样)
[01:24.14]I would do things and you’d get annoyed, yeah (我总是做一些让你厌烦的事情)
[01:28.12]Should’ve never done them (还不如不做呢)
[01:30.95]I wish that I was different (多希望我与众不同)
[01:35.43]Why do we have to step away, now (为什么我们要远离对方)
[01:37.91]It’s been a year, been a couple days now (恍如隔世，已过去了好几天)
[01:40.65]Since you called me (直到你打给我)
[01:43.31]Saying you’re worried (说你很担心)
[01:46.62]Been hard for me dealing with this space, now (保持着空间对我来说有点困难)
[01:49.52]No company, wishing we could sit down (没有陪伴，只希望我们能静坐下来)
[01:52.08]Cause I’m sorry (因为我很抱歉)
[01:54.53]But you don’t want me (然而你对我仍无他感)
[01:56.89]So lost in these diamonds (迷失在珠光宝气中)
[01:59.64]So lost in this paradise (迷失在人外极地中)
